	Place the Diskette which is to receive the copy into
	Drive 1(B) and Press "Do" when you are ready. The data
	on this diskette will be overwritten. You will hear the 
	drive buzzing and clicking and see the drive LEDs 
	alternately glowing as the copy takes place.

#6	W A R N I N G :
	      All previous data will be DESTROYED.
